"``var_value_filter`` (string) (optional) REQUIRED (or use "
"obs\\_value\\_filter) - Gene filter by symbol or Ensembl ID. Examples: "
"'feature\\_name in [\"TP53\", \"BRCA1\", \"EGFR\"]', 'feature\\_name == "
"\"CD4\"'. Common genes: TP53, EGFR, BRCA1, CD4, CD8A, IL6, TNF, GAPDH."
msgstr ""

